 8. 🌊 1 for the road: New cover stars 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Cover: Barry Blitt for The New Yorker For "Sea Change," the cover of next week's issue of The New Yorker, famed illustrator Barry Blitt drew six Democrats — James Talarico, Abdul El-Sayed, Keisha Lance Bottoms, Amy Acton, Troy Jackson and Gina Hinojosa — riding the midterms' blue wave.

 Blitt says: "The greatest relief is to finally have some new faces to draw." Go deeper . 

 
 
